{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fable: Manga Build Roguelike combines manga, tactical puzzles, and roguelike gameplay into one thrilling experience. Enjoy stylish pixel-art action while testing your flexible thinking and precise strategy!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1763363287\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1763363287 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/cf3b91372dd66b648b9e12f351e1f971.avif?t=1763363287\" width=1221 height=371 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/c714a543819c5246e8a14adefdd734e8.poster.avif?t=1763363287\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/c714a543819c5246e8a14adefdd734e8.webm?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/c714a543819c5246e8a14adefdd734e8.mp4?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect manga \u201cpanels\u201d and arrange them on a page to fight!</strong> <br>Each turn, you receive new panels. Placing them on the page creates your action sequence. Place panels according to the situation, build the ultimate page, and defeat your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1763363287\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1763363287 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/947b523b9fc126122ac670e1fcbe4fb8.avif?t=1763363287\" width=1275 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a5b6087877ca757b87154e542c6cefc8.poster.avif?t=1763363287\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a5b6087877ca757b87154e542c6cefc8.webm?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a5b6087877ca757b87154e542c6cefc8.mp4?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Experience three unique characters, each with their own style:</strong> <br>Akira \u2013 A genius hitman who masters gunfire and melee. <br>Yoko \u2013 Akira\u2019s partner who uses mobile attacks to outsmart enemies. <br>Suzuki \u2013 A cold-blooded assassin who uses traps and bullets to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1763363287\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1763363287 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/b2c30da45052a759d331834b86905266.avif?t=1763363287\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Damage during battles is represented as holes in the page.</strong>  <br>You cannot place panels in areas where there are holes.  <br>Carefully evaluate each situation and defeat all enemies within the turn limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1763363287\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1763363287 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/70d985c96bbac6c2f6e187fbdcb9682c.avif?t=1763363287\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/2e1d3d2b277c2c8cd335efb94b4ca436.poster.avif?t=1763363287\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/2e1d3d2b277c2c8cd335efb94b4ca436.webm?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/2e1d3d2b277c2c8cd335efb94b4ca436.mp4?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between tense battles, relax with surreal little mini-game events.  <br>Score high, and you\u2019ll have a chance to earn powerful new panels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1763363287\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1763363287 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/ea2875a642e6cedc18a28b5ea6289241.avif?t=1763363287\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who want to push their wit to the limit, there\u2019s Puzzle Mode.  <br>Use the given panels to defeat all enemies within a single page.  <br>(Even the developers don\u2019t know how much thought and time the hardest puzzles will take to solve. But don\u2019t give up\u2014there\u2019s always a solution!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1763363287\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1763363287 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/0c718e2ff4ee0af807db8936c8bdc131.avif?t=1763363287\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a870e6a6e48ddc9fbc524563338a6254.poster.avif?t=1763363287\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a870e6a6e48ddc9fbc524563338a6254.webm?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a870e6a6e48ddc9fbc524563338a6254.mp4?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, it wouldn\u2019t be The Fable without him\u2014Yuki, the playboy. At the bar, he challenges the beautiful Yoko to a drinking match. Can this reckless, foolish man impress the Drunk Queen Yoko, or will he just crash and burn?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mission 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/9eebd76f6d20142b4a05621366129e0135360aef.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/704ecce361d7c61385d73d2a07657543ce1295a7.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/b011c261c2a249b2dbe5202df2f0642446be79ff.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/ae15b6999851ff7a24271bc9fb47363345c592c4.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/bcc6b5d2467d673dd42a8bab70cbc3b805b5b9fd.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/b7b6607c5696481e343930ca6205e5ea1587dbf5.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/cf4e55b87a0b522cc2496f04123bb3517f43c6d1.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/77ab0da83557df3fa03c9cfff7c2a75e7aa9d9f2.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/6da54b685452fc4a4f304386f48aa7de9a1c9aaa.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3187880/0abbb21dc08c400eff937da45ffcd5e9772f3b05.jpg"}],"