eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/70d985c96bbac6c2f6e187fbdcb9682c.avif?t=1763363287\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/2e1d3d2b277c2c8cd335efb94b4ca436.poster.avif?t=1763363287\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/2e1d3d2b277c2c8cd335efb94b4ca436.webm?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/2e1d3d2b277c2c8cd335efb94b4ca436.mp4?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between tense battles, relax with surreal little mini-game events.  <br>Score high, and you\u2019ll have a chance to earn powerful new panels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1763363287\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1763363287 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/ea2875a642e6cedc18a28b5ea6289241.avif?t=1763363287\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who want to push their wit to the limit, there\u2019s Puzzle Mode.  <br>Use the given panels to defeat all enemies within a single page.  <br>(Even the developers don\u2019t know how much thought and time the hardest puzzles will take to solve. But don\u2019t give up\u2014there\u2019s always a solution!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.avif?t=1763363287\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras_big/532ba61f2311a4cab6890f59d6aef86d.webp?t=1763363287 width=1560 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/0c718e2ff4ee0af807db8936c8bdc131.avif?t=1763363287\" width=1280 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a870e6a6e48ddc9fbc524563338a6254.poster.avif?t=1763363287\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a870e6a6e48ddc9fbc524563338a6254.webm?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/extras/a870e6a6e48ddc9fbc524563338a6254.mp4?t=1763363287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, it wouldn\u2019t be The Fable without him\u2014Yuki, the playboy. At the bar, he challenges the beautiful Yoko to a drinking match. Can this reckless, foolish man impress the Drunk Queen Yoko, or will he just crash and burn?</p>","developers":["MONO ENTERTAINMENT"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187880/772d770b45a9ec2e8ea9eb12103b3e0a7bd8b78c/header.jpg?t=1763363287","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Katsuhisa Minami,KODANSHA / mono","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s